3. **伪造授权服务器** — 两条路，按客户端验签强度选：

   **A. 客户端只验字段、不验签名（或验的是可改的对称算法）** —— 直接伪造回包：
   ```python
   from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, HTTPServer
   import json

   class H(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):
       def do_POST(self):
           n = int(self.headers.get('Content-Length', 0))
           req = self.rfile.read(n)
           print("[REQ]", req)
           body = json.dumps({
               "code": 0,
               "status": "activated",
               "expire": "2099-12-31",
               "vip": True,
               "signature": "[按客户端算法算出的签名]"   # 对称 HMAC 就从客户端 dump 出来的 key 算
           }).encode()
           self.send_response(200)
           self.send_header('Content-Type', 'application/json')
           self.send_header('Content-Length', str(len(body)))
           self.end_headers()
           self.wfile.write(body)

   HTTPServer(('0.0.0.0', 443), H).serve_forever()
   ```
   走 HTTPS 就得配自签证书 + 客户端信任他；更省事的是 **改 hosts 把域名指到本机**，再用 Frida 给客户端的证书 pinning hook 掉：
   ```javascript
   // Android 7+ 需 root / 已装用户证书
   Java.perform(function () {
     var X509TrustManager = Java.use('javax.net.ssl.X509TrustManager');
     var SSLContext = Java.use('javax.net.ssl.SSLContext');
     var TM = Java.registerClass({
       name: 'com.x.TM',
       implements: [X509TrustManager],
       methods: {
         checkClientTrusted: function () {},
         checkServerTrusted: function () {},   // 空实现 = 信任任何证书
         getAcceptedIssuers: function () { return []; }
       }
     });
     var ctx = SSLContext.getInstance("TLS");
     ctx.init(null, [TM.$new()], null);
     SSLContext.getDefault.overload().implementation = function () { return ctx; };
   });
   ```
   hosts 改写（root 设备）：
   ```
   echo "127.0.0.1 [授权域名]" >> /system/etc/hosts
   ```

   **B. 客户端验非对称签名（RSA/ECDSA，公钥在客户端里）** —— 回包伪造不了，改验签函数：
   ```javascript
   Java.perform(function () {
     var V = Java.use("[包名].SignatureVerifier");
     V.verify.overload('byte[]', 'byte[]').implementation = function (data, sig) {
       console.log("[verify bypass] data len=" + data.length);
       return true;                       // 一律通过
     };
   });
   ```
   或者静态 patch 掉那个分支：jadx 里找到 `return verify(...)` 的调用点，smali 把 `invoke-static` 之后的条件跳转改掉，重打包：
   ```
   apktool d [apk] -o dec
   # 改 dec/smali/**/SignatureVerifier.smali
   apktool b dec -o patched.apk
   # 签名
   apksigner sign --ks [keystore] --out final.apk patched.apk
   ```

